OL,3,GNEWSAHopes new #87m surgical centre may
OL,4,Acut waiting lists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #87m surgical centre has opened
OL,7,Fat a Somerset hospital, with NHS
OL,8,Fleaders hoping it will reduce waiting
OL,9,Flists by increasing capacity and
OL,10,Fimproving patient flow.
OL,12,FThe King's Building at Musgrove Park
OL,13,FHospital in Taunton brings operating
OL,14,Ftheatres, endoscopy, admissions and
OL,15,Fintensive care together under one roof.
OL,16,FSomerset NHS Foundation Trust said it
OL,17,Fwas a major transformation of surgical
OL,18,Fcare.
OL,20,FThe centre includes eight operating
OL,21,Ftheatres, up from five, six endoscopy
OL,22,Frooms and a 22-bed intensive care unit.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
