OL,3,GNEWSAHopes new #87m surgical centre may
OL,4,Acut waiting lists
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Helen Hopwood said it offered a
OL,7,F"double bonus" of increased capacity
OL,8,Fand efficiency, allowing more
OL,9,Fprocedures and reducing the need for
OL,10,Fpatients to move around the hospital.
